er a failed attempt, share the logs folder from both devices." Style="{StaticResource MutedText}"/><Button x:Name="OpenLogsFolderButton" Content="Open logs folder" Click="OpenLogsFolder" Style="{StaticResource SettingsButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/><TextBlock Text="App updates" Style="{StaticResource SectionHeading}" Margin="0,24,0,10"/><CheckBox x:Name="AutoCheckUpdates" Content="Automatically check for updates" Checked="AutoUpdatesChanged" Unchecked="AutoUpdatesChanged"/><TextBlock Text="Checks at startup and every six hours. Updates install only when you click Update." Style="{StaticResource MutedText}"/><Button x:Name="CheckUpdatesButton" Content="Check for updates" Click="CheckUpdatesClick" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,12,0,8"/><TextBlock x:Name="UpdateStatus" Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" TextWrapping="Wrap" AutomationProperties.LiveSetting="Polite"/><TextBlock Text="About Watchroom" FontSize="20" Margin="0,28,0,12"/><TextBlock Text="Video playback by libVLC / LibVLCSharp. Peer connections by libdatachannel / DataChannelDotnet. Artwork by TVmaze (https://www.tvmaze.com, CC BY-SA), Wikipedia, and optional TMDB. Source pages appear in title details." Style="{StaticResource MutedText}"/><TextBlock Text="This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB." Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" Margin="0,12,0,0"/><TextBlock Text="Preview build. Public-server deployment and two-network playback validation are required before release." Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" Margin="0,16,0,0"/></StackPanel></ScrollViewer>
